# ...but the website MUST commit its .yarnrc.yml: it sets `nodeLinker: node-modules`.
# Without it CI (yarn 4) defaults to the PnP linker, which webpack/Docusaurus can't
# resolve, breaking the website build. (.yarn/ cache stays ignored.)
!website/.yarnrc.yml
